  metaDescription: 'Introduction Search has changed from a list of links into a multi-surface discovery system.',
  excerpt: 'Introduction Search has changed from a list of links into a multi-surface discovery system. A prospective buyer may still search Google for “enterprise CRM software,” but they may also ask Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, P…',
  category: 'ai-automation',
  publishedAt: '2026-09-11',
